Package: pivotWBnorah
Type: Package
Title: Reshape World Bank Indicator Data from Wide to Long Format
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Norah", "Alotaibi", email = "n.alotaibi@mail.utoronto.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: World Bank indicator files store one column per year (for
    example X2000, X2001, ...). This package converts such a file into a
    long country-year data set with one row per country and year, ready to
    be merged with other country-year data. It was written for the CHL5233
    armed conflict project, where the maternal, infant, neonatal and
    under-5 mortality files are each reshaped and then joined.
